                "acf_fc_layout": "text",
                "text_editor": "<h4><a href=\"https://www.acquia.com/products/drupal-cloud/cloud-platform?utm_source=o3world&amp;utm_medium=Website&amp;utm_campaign=NA_o3_microsite_2022&amp;utm_content=7016g0000020tRxAAI&amp;utm_term=o3_microsite\">Acquia cloud platform</a></h4>\n<p>Manage your site on a Drupal-tuned cloud, supported by a team of Drupal experts. Easy setup, secure hosting environment and scalable systems that power enterprise businesses and seamless customer experiences.</p>\n"
